    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>Eftersom \\(\\cos2x=2\\cos^2x-1\\) fås</p></li><li><p>\\[1+\\cos2x=\\boxed{2\\cos^2x}.\\]</p></li></ol></div>",
