    "geogebra": false,
    "t": "<p>Lös i intervallet \\(0\\le x&lt;360^\\circ\\).</p><p>a) \\(\\sin 2x=0\\)<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>b) \\(\\cos 2x=\\frac12\\)<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>c) \\(\\sin(3x)=1\\)<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>d) \\(\\tan(2x)=-1\\)</p>",
    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p class=\"facit-metod\"><strong>Tänk så här:</strong> Isolera den trigonometriska funktionen, hitta grundvinklarna i enhetscirkeln och använd sedan funktionens periodicitet för att få alla lösningar.</p></li></ol><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">a)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>\\(2x=180^\\circ n\\Rightarrow\\) <strong>\\(x=0^\\circ,90^\\circ,180^\\circ,270^\\circ\\)</strong>.</p></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">b)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>\\(2x=\\pm60^\\circ+360^\\circ n\\Rightarrow\\) <strong>\\(x=30^\\circ,150^\\circ,210^\\circ,330^\\circ\\)</strong>.</p></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">c)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>\\(3x=90^\\circ+360^\\circ n\\Rightarrow\\) <strong>\\(x=30^\\circ,150^\\circ,270^\\circ\\)</strong>.</p></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">d)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>\\(2x=-45^\\circ+180^\\circ n\\Rightarrow\\) <strong>\\(x=67{,}5^\\circ,157{,}5^\\circ,247{,}5^\\circ,337{,}5^\\circ\\)</strong>.</p></li></ol></div></div></div><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p class=\"facit-not\"><strong>Kontroll och insikt:</strong> Sätt in lösningarna i ursprungsekvationen och kontrollera att ingen lösningsfamilj saknas.</p></li></ol></div>",
