    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p class=\"facit-metod\"><strong>Metod:</strong> I \\(A\\sin(bx+c)+d\\) eller \\(A\\cos(bx+c)+d\\) är amplituden \\(|A|\\), medellinjen \\(y=d\\) och perioden \\(2\\pi/|b|\\).</p></li></ol><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">a)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>amplitud <strong>6</strong>, period <strong>\\(2\\pi/3\\)</strong>, medellinje <strong>\\(y=-2\\)</strong>.</p></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">b)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>amplitud <strong>2</strong>, period <strong>\\(8\\pi\\)</strong>, medellinje <strong>\\(y=5\\)</strong>.</p></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">c)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>amplitud <strong>1/2</strong>, period <strong>\\(2\\pi/5\\)</strong>, medellinje <strong>\\(y=0\\)</strong>.</p></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">d)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>amplitud <strong>4</strong>, period <strong>\\(\\pi\\)</strong>, medellinje <strong>\\(y=7\\)</strong>.</p></li></ol></div></div></div></div>",
