    "miniräknare": true,
    "geogebra": false,
    "t": "<p>En cirkelsektor har radien 5 cm och arean \\(25\\pi/6\\) cm².</p><div class=\"fig smal\"><svg width=\"440\" height=\"330\" viewBox=\"0 0 440 330\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"En cirkelsektor\"><rect x=\"1\" y=\"1\" width=\"438\" height=\"328\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\"/><path d=\"M187.9 245.0 L292.7 137.7 A150 150 0 0 0 147.3 100.6 Z\" fill=\"#f8dcd8\" stroke=\"#24262b\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M292.7 137.7 A150 150 0 0 0 147.3 100.6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#c0392b\" stroke-width=\"4.5\"/><circle cx=\"187.9\" cy=\"245.0\" r=\"3.5\" fill=\"#24262b\"/><path d=\"M208.8 223.5 A30 30 0 0 0 179.8 216.1\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#24262b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"203\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"15\">?</text><text x=\"259\" y=\"216\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"15\">5 cm</text><text x=\"216\" y=\"141\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"14\">A</text></svg></div><p>Bestäm sektorvinkeln exakt i radianer.</p>",
    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><div class=\"facit-berakning\"><p>För en sektor gäller</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[A=\\frac12r^2\\theta\\].</div></div></li><li><p>Alltså</p></li><li><p>\\[\\theta=\\frac{2A}{r^2}=\\frac{2\\cdot25\\pi/6}{25}=\\boxed{\\frac{\\pi}{3}}.\\]</p></li></ol></div>",
    "familj": "Båglängd, sektorarea och radianer",
    "formaga": [
      "procedur",
      "problemlösning"
    ],
