    "t": "<p>Omvandla.</p><p>a) \\(\\frac{7\\pi}{6}\\) rad till grader<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>b) \\(\\frac{5\\pi}{3}\\) rad till grader<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>c) \\(210^\\circ\\) till radianer<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>d) \\(330^\\circ\\) till radianer</p>",
    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p class=\"facit-metod\"><strong>Tänk så här:</strong> Ett halvt varv är både \\(180^\\circ\\) och \\(\\pi\\) radianer.</p></li><li><p class=\"facit-metod\">Använd detta som omvandlingsfaktor och behåll gärna exakta svar med \\(\\pi\\).</p></li></ol><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>Använd sambandet \\(180^\\circ=\\pi\\) rad.</p></li></ol><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">a)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[\\frac{7\\pi}{6}\\cdot\\frac{180^\\circ}{\\pi}=\\boxed{210^\\circ}\\].</div></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">b)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[\\frac{5\\pi}{3}\\cdot\\frac{180^\\circ}{\\pi}=\\boxed{300^\\circ}\\].</div></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">c)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[210^\\circ\\cdot\\frac{\\pi}{180^\\circ}=\\boxed{7\\pi/6}\\].</div></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">d)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[330^\\circ\\cdot\\frac{\\pi}{180^\\circ}=\\boxed{11\\pi/6}\\].</div></li></ol></div></div></div><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p class=\"facit-not\"><strong>Kontroll och insikt:</strong> Kontrollera mot kända vinklar som \\(90^\\circ=\\pi/2\\) och \\(180^\\circ=\\pi\\).</p></li></ol></div>",
