    "t": "<p>En cirkelsektor har radien 6 cm och medelpunktsvinkeln \\(\\pi/3\\) rad. Bestäm sektorns area.</p><div class=\"fig smal\"><svg width=\"440\" height=\"330\" viewBox=\"0 0 440 330\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"En cirkelsektor\"><rect x=\"1\" y=\"1\" width=\"438\" height=\"328\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\"/><path d=\"M187.9 245.0 L292.7 137.7 A150 150 0 0 0 147.3 100.6 Z\" fill=\"#fbe6cc\" stroke=\"#24262b\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M292.7 137.7 A150 150 0 0 0 147.3 100.6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#d9822b\" stroke-width=\"4.5\"/><circle cx=\"187.9\" cy=\"245.0\" r=\"3.5\" fill=\"#24262b\"/><path d=\"M208.8 223.5 A30 30 0 0 0 179.8 216.1\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#24262b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"201\" y=\"199\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"15\">π/3</text><text x=\"259\" y=\"216\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"15\">6 cm</text><text x=\"216\" y=\"141\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"14\">A</text></svg></div>",
    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p><strong>Nyckelidé:</strong> En sektor med vinkeln \\(v\\) rad utgör andelen \\(v/(2\\pi)\\) av hela cirkeln.</p></li><li><div class=\"facit-berakning\"><p>Därför blir arean</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[A=\\frac12r^2v\\].</div></div></li><li><p>Insättning ger \\(A\\approx 18{,}8496\\text{ cm}^2\\).</p></li></ol><p class=\"facit-svar\"><strong>Svar:</strong> \\(\\boxed{18{,}8496\\text{ cm}^2}\\).</p></div>",
