    "t": "<p>En cirkelsektor har vinkeln 1,5 rad och arean 48 cm².</p><div class=\"fig smal\"><svg width=\"440\" height=\"330\" viewBox=\"0 0 440 330\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"En cirkelsektor\"><rect x=\"1\" y=\"1\" width=\"438\" height=\"328\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\"/><path d=\"M192.8 245.0 L319.1 163.9 A150 150 0 0 0 120.9 113.4 Z\" fill=\"#cdeff1\" stroke=\"#24262b\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M319.1 163.9 A150 150 0 0 0 120.9 113.4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1f9aa3\" stroke-width=\"4.5\"/><circle cx=\"192.8\" cy=\"245.0\" r=\"3.5\" fill=\"#24262b\"/><path d=\"M218.1 228.8 A30 30 0 0 0 178.5 218.7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#24262b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"208\" y=\"191\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"15\">1,5 rad</text><text x=\"264\" y=\"224\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"15\">r</text><text x=\"221\" y=\"141\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"14\">48 cm²</text></svg></div><p>Bestäm radien.</p>",
    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>\\[48=\\frac12r^2\\cdot1{,}5=0{,}75r^2\\Rightarrow r^2=64.\\]</p></li><li><div class=\"facit-berakning\"><p>Alltså</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[\\boxed{r=8\\text{ cm}}\\].</div></div></li></ol></div>",
