    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p><strong>Nyckelidé:</strong> Bestäm vilken deriveringsregel som behövs innan du börjar förenkla.</p></li><li><p>Skriv mellanled så att varje faktor i derivatan kan följas.</p></li></ol><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">a)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>\\[\nf'(x)=4x^3-6x.\n\\]</p></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">b)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>Kedjeregeln ger</p></li></ol></div></div><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>\\[\ng'(x)=5\\cos5x.\n\\]</p></li></ol><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">c)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"></div></div><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>\\[\nh'(x)=5(3x-4)^4\\cdot3=15(3x-4)^4.\n\\]</p></li></ol><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">d)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"></div></div><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>\\[\np'(x)=2e^{2x}.\n\\]</p></li></ol></div>",
