    "geogebra": false,
    "t": "<p>Derivera.</p><p>a) \\(f(x)=\\sin4x\\)<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>b) \\(g(x)=(3x-1)^7\\)<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>c) \\(h(x)=x^4e^x\\)</p>",
    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">a)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><div class=\"facit-berakning\"><p>Kedjeregeln ger</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[f'(x)=\\boxed{4\\cos4x}\\].</div></div></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">b)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>Yttre derivatan ger \\(7(3x-1)^6\\) och den inre derivatan är 3:</p></li></ol></div></div><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>\\[g'(x)=\\boxed{21(3x-1)^6}.\\]</p></li></ol><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">c)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>Produktregeln:</p></li></ol></div></div><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>\\[h'(x)=4x^3e^x+x^4e^x=\\boxed{e^x(4x^3+x^4)}.\\]</p></li></ol></div></div>",
