    "geogebra": false,
    "t": "<p>Derivera.</p><p>a) \\(x^4\\)<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>b) \\(3x^5-2x^2\\)<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>c) \\(1/x\\)<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>d) \\(\\sqrt{x}\\)</p>",
    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">a)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[(x^4)'=\\boxed{4x^3}\\].</div></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">b)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[(3x^5-2x^2)'=\\boxed{15x^4-4x}\\].</div></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">c)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>Skriv \\(1/x=x^{-1}\\): \\((x^{-1})'=\\boxed{-x^{-2}}\\).</p></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">d)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>Skriv \\(\\sqrt{x}=x^{1/2}\\): \\((x^{1/2})'=\\boxed{1/(2\\sqrt{x})}\\).</p></li></ol></div></div></div>",
