    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p><strong>Metod:</strong> Derivera den yttre funktionen och multiplicera med derivatan av den inre funktionen.</p></li></ol><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">a)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p><strong>\\(f'(x)=3e^{3x-2}\\)</strong>.</p></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">b)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p><strong>\\(g'(x)=\\frac{2}{2x+5}\\)</strong>.</p></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">c)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p><strong>\\(h'(x)=4\\cos(4x-1)\\)</strong>.</p></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">d)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p><strong>\\(p'(x)=-2x\\sin(x^2)\\)</strong>.</p></li></ol></div></div></div>",
