    "niva": "C",
    "poang": "0/3/0",
    "miniräknare": true,
    "geogebra": true,
    "t": "<p>Låt</p><p>\\[f(u)=\\sin u,\\qquad g(x)=\\frac{x^2}{3}+0{,}5x.\\]</p><p>Funktionen \\(h\\) definieras av \\(h(x)=f(g(x))\\).</p><p>a) Bestäm alla lösningar till \\(h(x)=0,6\\) för \\(0\\le x\\le4\\).<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>b) Bestäm \\(h'(x)\\) i den minsta av lösningarna.</p>",
    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">a)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>\\[h(x)=\\sin\\left(\\frac{x^2}{3}+0,5x\\right).\\]</p></li></ol></div></div><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>En grafisk lösning ger</p></li><li><p>\\[x\\approx0{,}829;\\ 2{,}088;\\ 3{,}870.\\]</p></li></ol><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">b)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>Kedjeregeln ger</p></li></ol></div></div><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>\\[h'(x)=\\cos(g(x))\\left(\\frac{2x}{3}+0,5\\right).\\]</p></li><li><p>Vid \\(x\\approx0{,}829\\) fås</p></li><li><p>\\[\\boxed{h'(x)\\approx0{,}842}.\\]</p></li></ol></div></div>",
