    "geogebra": false,
    "t": "<p>Derivera.</p><p>a) \\(f(x)=(1-2x)^7\\)<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>b) \\(g(x)=e^{x^2}\\)<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>c) \\(h(x)=\\ln(x^2+4)\\)<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>d) \\(p(x)=\\sin(5x^2)\\)</p>",
    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p><strong>Metod:</strong> Derivera den yttre funktionen och multiplicera med derivatan av den inre funktionen.</p></li></ol><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">a)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[\\boxed{-14(1-2x)^6}\\]</div></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">b)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[\\boxed{2xe^{x^2}}\\]</div></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">c)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[\\boxed{2x/(x^2+4)}\\]</div></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">d)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[\\boxed{10x\\cos(5x^2)}\\]</div></li></ol></div></div></div>",
