    "t": "<p>Derivera och förenkla.</p><p>a) \\((1+e^x)^4\\)<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>b) \\(e^{\\sin x}\\)<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>c) \\(\\sin^3x\\)<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>d) \\((\\ln x)^5\\)</p>",
    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p><strong>Metod:</strong> I varje del används kedjeregeln: derivera den yttre funktionen och multiplicera med derivatan av det som står inuti.</p></li></ol><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">a)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[4(1+e^x)^3\\cdot e^x=\\boxed{4e^x(1+e^x)^3}\\].</div></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">b)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[e^{\\sin x}\\cdot(\\sin x)'=\\boxed{e^{\\sin x}\\cos x}\\].</div></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">c)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[3\\sin^2x\\cdot(\\sin x)'=\\boxed{3\\sin^2x\\cos x}\\].</div></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">d)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[5(\\ln x)^4\\cdot(\\ln x)'=\\boxed{\\frac{5(\\ln x)^4}{x}}\\].</div></li></ol></div></div></div>",
