    "geogebra": false,
    "t": "<p>Identifiera den <strong>inre funktionen</strong> i varje sammansättning.</p><p>a) \\(\\ln(1+x^2)\\)</p><p>b) \\(\\sin(e^x)\\)</p><p>c) \\((1+\\cos x)^4\\)</p>",
    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">a)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>\\(u=1+x^2\\).<br>b) \\(u=e^x\\).<br>c) \\(u=1+\\cos x\\).</p></li></ol></div></div><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>Att identifiera \\(u\\) korrekt gör kedjeregelns extra faktor tydlig.</p></li></ol></div>",
