    "t": "<p>Bestäm a så att \\(f(x)=(ax+1)^5\\) uppfyller \\(f'(0)=15\\).</p>",
    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>Kedjeregeln ger</p></li><li><p>\\[f'(x)=5a(ax+1)^4.\\]</p></li><li><p>Vid \\(x=0\\): \\(f'(0)=5a=15\\), alltså \\(\\boxed{a=3}\\).</p></li></ol></div>",
