    "t": "<p>Derivera.</p><p>a) \\(4\\sin x\\)<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>b) \\(7\\cos x\\)<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>c) \\(3\\sin(2x)\\)<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>d) \\(5\\cos(4x-1)\\)</p>",
    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p><strong>Metod:</strong> Använd \\((\\sin u)'=\\cos u\\cdot u'\\) och \\((\\cos u)'=-\\sin u\\cdot u'\\).</p></li><li><p>I c och d behövs kedjeregeln.</p></li></ol><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">a)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[(4\\sin x)'=\\boxed{4\\cos x}\\].</div></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">b)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[(7\\cos x)'=\\boxed{-7\\sin x}\\].</div></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">c)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[(3\\sin(2x))'=3\\cos(2x)\\cdot2=\\boxed{6\\cos(2x)}\\].</div></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">d)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[(5\\cos(4x-1))'=5[-\\sin(4x-1)]\\cdot4=\\boxed{-20\\sin(4x-1)}\\].</div></li></ol></div></div></div>",
