    "t": "<p>Derivera.</p><p>a) \\(\\sin(5x)\\)<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>b) \\(\\cos(4x)\\)<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>c) \\(\\tan(3x)\\)<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>d) \\(2\\cos(\\pi x)\\)</p>",
    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p><strong>Nyckelidé:</strong> Identifiera den yttre och den inre funktionen.</p></li><li><p>Derivera den yttre och multiplicera med den inre funktionens derivata.</p></li></ol><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">a)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p><strong>\\(5\\cos5x\\)</strong>.<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>b) <strong>\\(-4\\sin4x\\)</strong>.<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>c) <strong>\\(\\frac{3}{\\cos^2(3x)}\\)</strong>.<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>d) <strong>\\(-2\\pi\\sin(\\pi x)\\)</strong>.</p></li></ol></div></div></div>",
