        "fraga": "<p>\\(\\ln(3x)\\)</p>",
        "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p><strong>Metod:</strong> För \\(\\ln u(x)\\) gäller \\((\\ln u)'=u'/u\\).</p></li></ol><div class=\"spel-en-del\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[(\\ln(3x))'=\\frac{3}{3x}=\\boxed{1/x}\\].</div></li></ol></div></div>",
