    "geogebra": false,
    "t": "<p>Derivera.</p><p>a) \\(3\\sin x\\)<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>b) \\(-4\\cos x\\)<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>c) \\(2\\sin x+5\\cos x\\)<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>d) \\(7-\\cos x\\)</p>",
    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p><strong>Metod:</strong> Derivera term för term och använd \\((\\sin x)'=\\cos x\\) och \\((\\cos x)'=-\\sin x\\).</p></li></ol><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">a)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>\\(\\boxed{3\\cos x}\\).</p></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">b)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[-4(-\\sin x)=\\boxed{4\\sin x}\\].</div></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">c)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>\\(\\boxed{2\\cos x-5\\sin x}\\).</p></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">d)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>Konstanten 7 får derivatan 0 och \\((-\\cos x)'=\\sin x\\), alltså \\(\\boxed{\\sin x}\\).</p></li></ol></div></div></div>",
