    "t": "<p>Lös ekvationerna.</p><p>a) \\(\\ln x=0\\)<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>b) \\(\\ln x=2\\)<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>c) \\(\\ln(x-1)=\\ln5\\)<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>d) \\(2\\ln x=\\ln16\\)</p>",
    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p><strong>Nyckelidé:</strong> Bestäm vilken deriveringsregel som behövs innan du börjar förenkla.</p></li><li><p>Skriv mellanled så att varje faktor i derivatan kan följas.</p></li></ol><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">a)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p><strong>\\(x=1\\)</strong>.<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>b) <strong>\\(x=e^2\\)</strong>.<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>c) <strong>\\(x=6\\)</strong>.<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>d) \\(\\ln(x^2)=\\ln16\\) och \\(x&gt;0\\), alltså <strong>\\(x=4\\)</strong>.</p></li></ol></div></div></div>",
