    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p><strong>Nyckelidé:</strong> Bestäm vilken deriveringsregel som behövs innan du börjar förenkla.</p></li><li><p>Skriv mellanled så att varje faktor i derivatan kan följas.</p></li></ol><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">a)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[4e^{4x}\\].</div></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">b)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>\\(3/(3x+1)\\).</p></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">c)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>\\(5\\cos5x\\).</p></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">d)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>\\(-2\\sin2x\\).</p></li></ol></div></div></div>",
