    "t": "<p>Derivera.</p><p>a) \\(e^{-2x}\\)<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>b) \\(\\ln(x^2+1)\\)<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>c) \\(\\sin(5x)\\)<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>d) \\(\\cos(x/3)\\)</p>",
    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p><strong>Nyckelidé:</strong> Identifiera den yttre och den inre funktionen.</p></li><li><p>Derivera den yttre och multiplicera med den inre funktionens derivata.</p></li></ol><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">a)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p><strong>\\(-2e^{-2x}\\)</strong>.</p></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">b)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p><strong>\\(2x/(x^2+1)\\)</strong>.</p></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">c)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p><strong>\\(5\\cos5x\\)</strong>.</p></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">d)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p><strong>\\(-(1/3)\\sin(x/3)\\)</strong>.</p></li></ol></div></div></div>",
