        "fraga": "<p>Bestäm funktionens minsta värde.</p>",
        "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">b)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>Derivatan är\n\\[f'(x)=\\frac1{x-1}-\\frac2{(x-1)^2}=\\frac{x-3}{(x-1)^2}.\\]\nMinimum fås vid \\(x=3\\):\n\\[f(3)=\\ln2+1\\approx\\boxed{1{,}693}.\\]</p></li></ol></div></div></div>",
