    "miniräknare": true,
    "geogebra": true,
    "t": "<p>Bestäm lodräta och vågräta asymptoter. Skriv den vågräta asymptotens y-värde i svarsrutan för varje deluppgift.</p><p>a) \\(f(x)=\\frac{3}{x-2}+1\\)<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>b) \\(g(x)=\\frac{2x+1}{x-4}\\)<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>c) \\(h(x)=\\frac{5x^2-1}{x^2+3}\\)<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>d) \\(p(x)=\\frac{1}{(x+1)(x-3)}\\)</p>",
    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">a)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>lodrät <strong>\\(x=2\\)</strong>, vågrät <strong>\\(y=1\\)</strong>.</p></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">b)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>lodrät <strong>\\(x=4\\)</strong>, vågrät <strong>\\(y=2\\)</strong>.</p></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">c)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>inga lodräta asymptoter eftersom \\(x^2+3&gt;0\\); vågrät <strong>\\(y=5\\)</strong>.</p></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">d)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>lodräta <strong>\\(x=-1\\)</strong> och <strong>\\(x=3\\)</strong>; vågrät <strong>\\(y=0\\)</strong>.</p></li></ol></div></div></div>",
