    "geogebra": true,
    "t": "<p>Bestäm den sneda asymptoten.</p><p>a) \\(f(x)=\\frac{x^2+3x+1}{x+1}\\)<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>b) \\(g(x)=\\frac{2x^2-x+4}{x-2}\\)<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>c) \\(h(x)=\\frac{x^2-4}{x-1}\\)</p>",
    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p><strong>Metod:</strong> För lodräta asymptoter undersöks var nämnaren blir noll.</p></li><li><p>För vågräta eller sneda asymptoter studeras hur funktionen beter sig när \\(|x|\\) blir stor.</p></li><li><p>Polynomdivision:</p></li></ol><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">a)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>\\(x^2+3x+1=(x+1)(x+2)-1\\), alltså asymptot <strong>\\(y=x+2\\)</strong>.</p></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">b)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>\\(2x^2-x+4=(x-2)(2x+3)+10\\), alltså <strong>\\(y=2x+3\\)</strong>.</p></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">c)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>\\(x^2-4=(x-1)(x+1)-3\\), alltså <strong>\\(y=x+1\\)</strong>.</p></li></ol></div></div></div>",
