    "geogebra": false,
    "t": "<p>Beräkna.</p><p>a) \\(\\int_0^2(3x^2+1)\\,dx\\)<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>b) \\(\\int_0^{\\pi/2}\\cos x\\,dx\\)<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>c) \\(\\int_1^e\\frac{1}{x}\\,dx\\)<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>d) \\(\\int_0^1e^x\\,dx\\)</p>",
    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p><strong>Metod:</strong> Bestäm först en primitiv funktion och sätt sedan in den övre och den undre gränsen.</p></li></ol><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">a)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>\\(\\int(3x^2+1)dx=x^3+x\\), så \\([x^3+x]_0^2=8+2=\\boxed{10}\\).</p></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">b)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>\\(\\int\\cos x\\,dx=\\sin x\\), så \\([\\sin x]_0^{\\pi/2}=1-0=\\boxed{1}\\).</p></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">c)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>För \\(x&gt;0\\) är \\(\\int\\frac{1}{x} dx=\\ln x\\), så \\([\\ln x]_1^e=1-0=\\boxed{1}\\).</p></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">d)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[[e^x]_0^1=e-1=\\boxed{e-1}\\].</div></li></ol></div></div></div>",
