    "geogebra": false,
    "t": "<p>Beräkna.</p><p>a) \\(\\int_0^2 3x^2\\,dx\\)<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>b) \\(\\int_1^3(2x+1)\\,dx\\)<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>c) \\(\\int_0^1 e^x\\,dx\\)<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>d) \\(\\int_0^{\\pi/2}\\cos x\\,dx\\)</p>",
    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><div class=\"facit-berakning\"><p><strong>Metod:</strong> Bestäm en primitiv funktion och använd</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[\\int_a^b f(x)dx=F(b)-F(a)\\].</div></div></li></ol><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">a)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[[x^3]_0^2=8-0=\\boxed{8}\\].</div></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">b)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[[x^2+x]_1^3=(9+3)-(1+1)=\\boxed{10}\\].</div></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">c)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[[e^x]_0^1=e-1=\\boxed{e-1}\\].</div></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">d)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[[\\sin x]_0^{\\pi/2}=1-0=\\boxed{1}\\].</div></li></ol></div></div></div>",
