    "t": "<p>Bestäm en primitiv funktion till varje funktion.</p><p>a) \\((4x+1)^3\\)<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>b) \\(e^{5x}\\)<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>c) \\(\\cos(x/2)\\)<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>d) \\(\\frac1{3x-1}\\), \\(x&gt;1/3\\)</p>",
    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p><strong>Metod:</strong> Hitta en funktion vars derivata är den givna funktionen.</p></li><li><p>Kontrollera gärna genom att derivera.</p></li><li><p>Ett svar som skiljer sig med en konstant är också en primitiv funktion.</p></li></ol><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">a)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[\\boxed{\\frac{(4x+1)^4}{16}}\\].</div></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">b)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[\\boxed{\\frac15e^{5x}}\\].</div></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">c)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>\\(\\boxed{2\\sin(x/2)}\\).</p></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">d)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[\\boxed{\\frac13\\ln(3x-1)}\\].</div></li></ol></div></div><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>En godtycklig konstant kan läggas till.</p></li></ol></div>",
