        "fraga": "<p>Bestäm den producerade energin under de sex timmarna.</p>",
        "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">b)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>\\[E=\\int_0^6 4,2t(6-t)dt=4,2\\left[3t^2-\\frac{t^3}{3}\\right]_0^6.\\]\n\\[E=4{,}2(108-72)=\\boxed{151{,}2\\text{ kWh}}.\\]</p></li></ol></div></div></div>",
