        "fraga": "<p>Bestäm \\(k\\).</p>",
        "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">a)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>Arean under en täthetsfunktion ska vara 1:\n\\[\\int_0^4kx(4-x)\\,dx=1.\\]\n\\[k\\int_0^4(4x-x^2)\\,dx=k\\left[2x^2-\\frac{x^3}{3}\\right]_0^4=k\\frac{32}{3}=1.\\]\nAlltså\n\\[\\boxed{k=\\frac3{32}}.\\]</p></li></ol></div></div></div>",
        "niva": "C",
