        "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">b)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>\\[P(1\\le X\\le3)=\\int_1^3\\frac3{32}x(4-x)\\,dx=\\boxed{\\frac{11}{16}\\approx0{,}688}.\\]</p></li></ol></div></div></div>",
