        "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">b)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>\\[P=\\int_{1/2}^{3/2}\\frac34x(2-x)\\,dx.\\]\nEn primitiv funktion är \\(\\frac34x^2-\\frac14x^3\\).</p></li><li><div class=\"facit-berakning\"><p>Insättning ger</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[P=11/16\\].</div></div></li></ol></div></div></div>",
