    "t": "<p>Funktionen \\(f(x)=kx\\) för \\(0\\le x\\le2\\) och \\(f(x)=0\\) annars ska vara en täthetsfunktion.</p><p>a) Bestäm \\(k\\).<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>b) Bestäm \\(P(X\\le1)\\).<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>c) Bestäm \\(P(1\\le X\\le2)\\).</p>",
    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p><strong>Nyckelidé:</strong> En täthetsfunktion måste ha total area 1.</p></li><li><p>Sannolikheter fås som integraler över de intervall som motsvarar händelsen.</p></li></ol><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">a)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[1=\\int_0^2kx dx=2k\\Rightarrow\\boxed{k=1/2}\\].</div></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">b)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[\\int_0^x/2\\,dx=[x^2/4]_0^1=\\boxed{1/4}\\].</div></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">c)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[1-1/4=\\boxed{3/4}\\].</div></li></ol></div></div></div>",
