        "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><div class=\"spel-en-del\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[1=\\int_0^2kx dx=2k\\Rightarrow\\boxed{k=1/2}\\].</div></li></ol></div></div>",
