        "fraga": "<p>Bestäm \\(k\\).</p>",
        "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><div class=\"spel-en-del\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>En täthetsfunktion måste ha total area 1:</p></li></ol></div><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>\\[1=k\\int_0^2(2x-x^2)dx=k\\left[x^2-\\frac{x^3}{3}\\right]_0^2=k\\frac43.\\]</p></li><li><div class=\"facit-berakning\"><p>Alltså</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[k=\\boxed{3/4}\\].</div></div></li></ol></div>",
        "niva": "C",
