        "fraga": "<p>\\(f(x)=kx\\)<br>för \\(0\\le x\\le2\\).</p>",
        "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>En täthetsfunktion ska ha total integral 1.</p></li></ol><div class=\"spel-en-del\"><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">b)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>\\(k[x^2/2]_0^2=2k=1\\Rightarrow\\) \\(k=\\frac12\\) .</p></li></ol></div></div></div></div>",
