        "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[\\displaystyle\\int_{-1}^1kx^2\\,dx=\\frac{2k}{3}=1\\iff k=\\frac32\\].</div></li></ol><p class=\"facit-svar\"><strong>Svar:</strong> \\(k=\\dfrac32\\)</p></div>",
