        "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>\\(\\displaystyle\\int_{-2}^2(4-x^2)\\,dx=16-\\frac{16}{3}=\\frac{32}{3}\\), så \\(k=\\dfrac{3}{32}\\).</p></li></ol><p class=\"facit-svar\"><strong>Svar:</strong> \\(k=\\dfrac{3}{32}\\)</p></div>",
