    "t": "<p>Slumpvariabeln \\(x\\) har täthetsfunktionen \\(f(x)=\\dfrac{3}{256}(16-x^2)\\) för \\(-4\\le x\\le4\\).</p><ol type=\"a\"><li>Bestäm \\(P(x\\lt-2)\\).</li><li>Bestäm \\(P(-1\\lt x\\lt1)\\).</li></ol>",
    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><ol type=\"a\"><li><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[\\dfrac{3}{256}\\left[16x-\\dfrac{x^3}{3}\\right]_{-4}^{-2}=\\dfrac{3}{256}\\left(-\\dfrac{88}{3}+\\dfrac{128}{3}\\right)=\\dfrac{40}{256}=\\dfrac{5}{32}\\approx0{,}156\\].</div></li></ol><p class=\"facit-svar\"><strong>Svar:</strong> \\(\\dfrac{5}{32}\\)</p></li><li><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[\\dfrac{3}{256}\\left[16x-\\dfrac{x^3}{3}\\right]_{-1}^{1}=\\dfrac{3}{256}\\cdot\\dfrac{94}{3}=\\dfrac{94}{256}=\\dfrac{47}{128}\\approx0{,}367\\].</div></li></ol><p class=\"facit-svar\"><strong>Svar:</strong> \\(\\dfrac{47}{128}\\)</p></li></ol></div>",
