        "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[\\dfrac{3}{256}\\left[16x-\\dfrac{x^3}{3}\\right]_{-1}^{1}=\\dfrac{3}{256}\\cdot\\dfrac{94}{3}=\\dfrac{94}{256}=\\dfrac{47}{128}\\approx0{,}367\\].</div></li></ol><p class=\"facit-svar\"><strong>Svar:</strong> \\(\\dfrac{47}{128}\\)</p></div>",
