    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><div class=\"facit-berakning\"><p><strong>Formelbladet:</strong> Vid rotation kring y-axeln gäller</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[V=\\pi\\int_a^b x^2\\,dy\\].</div></div></li><li><p>Eftersom \\(x=\\sqrt y\\) blir \\(x^2=y\\):</p></li><li><p>\\[V=\\pi\\int_0^4 y\\,dy=\\pi\\left[\\frac{y^2}{2}\\right]_0^4=\\boxed{8\\pi}.\\]</p></li></ol></div>",
    "familj": "Rotationsvolymer",
