    "miniräknare": false,
    "geogebra": false,
    "t": "<p>Beräkna.</p>\n<p>a) \\(i^2\\)<br>\nb) \\(i^{19}\\)<br>\nc) \\((3+2i)+(5-7i)\\)<br>\nd) \\((2+i)(3-4i)\\)</p>",
    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">a)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p><strong>\\(i^2=-1\\)</strong>.</p></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">b)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>Potenserna av \\(i\\) upprepas med perioden 4.</p></li><li><div class=\"facit-berakning\"><p>Eftersom</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[19=4\\cdot4+3\\]:</div></div></li></ol></div></div><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>\\[\ni^{19}=i^3=-i.\n\\]</p></li></ol><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">c)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"></div></div><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>\\[\n(3+2i)+(5-7i)=8-5i.\n\\]</p></li></ol><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">d)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"></div></div><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>\\[\n(2+i)(3-4i)=6-8i+3i-4i^2=10-5i.\n\\]</p></li></ol></div>",
