    "geogebra": false,
    "t": "<p>Dividera och skriv svaret på formen \\(a+bi\\).</p><p>a) \\(\\frac{3+i}{1-i}\\)<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>b) \\(\\frac{5-5i}{1+i}\\)<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>c) \\(\\frac{4}{2-i}\\)<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>d) \\(\\frac{2+6i}{3i}\\)</p>",
    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p class=\"facit-metod\"><strong>Tänk så här:</strong> Välj den form som passar operationen: rektangulär form för addition och polär form för multiplikation, division och potenser.</p></li></ol><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">a)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>Multiplicera med \\(1+i\\): \\(\\frac{(3+i)(1+i)}2=\\boxed{1+2i}\\).</p></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">b)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[\\frac{(5-5i)(1-i)}2=\\frac{-10i}{2}=\\boxed{-5i}\\].</div></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">c)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[\\frac{4(2+i)}5=\\boxed{\\frac85+\\frac45i}\\].</div></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">d)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[\\frac{2+6i}{3i}\\cdot\\frac{-i}{-i}=\\frac{6-2i}{3}=\\boxed{2-\\frac23i}\\].</div></li></ol></div></div></div><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p class=\"facit-not\"><strong>Kontroll och insikt:</strong> Omvandla tillbaka till rektangulär form eller multiplicera med konjugatet för att kontrollera resultatet.</p></li></ol></div>",
