    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p><strong>Metod:</strong> Potenser av \\(i\\) upprepas i period 4: \\(1,i,-1,-i\\).</p></li></ol><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">a)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>\\(37\\equiv1\\pmod4\\Rightarrow\\boxed{i}\\).</p></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">b)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>\\(58\\equiv2\\pmod4\\Rightarrow\\boxed{-1}\\).</p></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">c)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>\\(103\\equiv3\\pmod4\\Rightarrow\\boxed{-i}\\).</p></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">d)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>\\(200\\equiv0\\pmod4\\Rightarrow\\boxed{1}\\).</p></li></ol></div></div></div>",
