    "geogebra": false,
    "t": "<p>Förenkla.</p><p>a) \\(i^{17}\\)<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>b) \\(i^{42}\\)<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>c) \\(i^{103}\\)</p>",
    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p><strong>Metod:</strong> Potenserna av \\(i\\) upprepas var fjärde exponent: \\(i,i^2=-1,i^3=-i,i^4=1\\).</p></li></ol><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">a)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[17=4\\cdot4+1\\Rightarrow i^{17}=i\\].</div></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">b)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[42=4\\cdot10+2\\Rightarrow i^{42}=i^2=\\boxed{-1}\\].</div></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">c)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[103=4\\cdot25+3\\Rightarrow i^{103}=i^3=\\boxed{-i}\\].</div></li></ol></div></div></div>",
