    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p><strong>Nyckelidé:</strong> Skriv talet på polär form.</p></li><li><p>För n:te rötter delas argumentet θ+2πk med n så att alla olika rötter kommer med.</p></li><li><div class=\"facit-berakning\"><p>Använd</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[i^2=-1\\],</div></div></li><li><p>\\(i^3=-i\\) och \\(i^4=1\\).</p></li></ol><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">a)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[7-3=\\boxed{4}\\].</div></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">b)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[-2i-5i=\\boxed{-7i}\\].</div></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">c)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[4-6=\\boxed{-2}\\].</div></li></ol></div></div></div>",
