    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p><strong>Metod:</strong> Använd \\(i^2=-1\\), vilket ger \\(i^3=-i\\) och \\(i^4=1\\).</p></li></ol><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">a)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[3i^2=3(-1)=\\boxed{-3}\\].</div></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">b)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[2i^3-5i=2(-i)-5i=\\boxed{-7i}\\].</div></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">c)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[i^4+i^2=1-1=\\boxed{0}\\].</div></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">d)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[(2i)^4=2^4i^4=16\\cdot1=\\boxed{16}\\].</div></li></ol></div></div></div>",
