    "t": "<p>Förenkla.</p><p>a) \\(i^{23}\\)<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>b) \\(i^{48}\\)<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>c) \\(i^{101}+i^{102}\\)<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>d) \\(\\frac1i\\)</p>",
    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p class=\"facit-metod\"><strong>Tänk så här:</strong> Använd en potens- eller logaritmlag i taget och skriv mellanled.</p></li><li><p class=\"facit-metod\">Det gör tecken, exponenter och eventuella villkor synliga.</p></li></ol><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">a)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>\\(23\\equiv3\\pmod4\\Rightarrow\\boxed{-i}\\).</p></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">b)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>\\(48\\equiv0\\pmod4\\Rightarrow\\boxed{1}\\).</p></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">c)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[i^{101}=i\\],</div></li><li><p>\\(i^{102}=-1\\), alltså <strong>\\(-1+i\\)</strong>.</p></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">d)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>Multiplicera med \\(i/i\\): \\(1/i=i/i^2=\\boxed{-i}\\).</p></li></ol></div></div></div></div>",
