    "t": "<p>Beräkna och skriv svaret på formen \\(a+bi\\).</p><p>a) \\(\\frac{3+i}{1-i}\\)<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>b) \\(\\frac{5-3i}{2+i}\\)<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>c) \\(\\frac{4+2i}{1+2i}\\)<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>d) \\(\\frac{1-5i}{2-i}\\)</p>",
    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p><strong>Metod:</strong> Multiplicera täljare och nämnare med nämnarens konjugat.</p></li></ol><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">a)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>\\[\\frac{3+i}{1-i}\\cdot\\frac{1+i}{1+i}=\\frac{2+4i}{2}=\\boxed{1+2i}.\\]</p></li></ol></div></div><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>På samma sätt fås</p></li></ol><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">b)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>\\(\\boxed{\\frac75-\\frac{11}{5}i}\\).<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>c) \\(\\boxed{\\frac85-\\frac65 i}\\).<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>d) \\(\\boxed{\\frac75-\\frac95 i}\\).</p></li></ol></div></div></div>",
