    "t": "<p>Varje komplext tal räknas om med regeln</p><p>\\[w=(1+i)z-2.\\]</p><p>Triangelns hörn är \\(z_1=0\\), \\(z_2=2\\) och \\(z_3=2i\\).</p><span class=\"fig\"><svg preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" width=\"450\" height=\"320\" viewBox=\"0 0 450 320\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\">\n<rect x=\"1\" y=\"1\" width=\"448\" height=\"318\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#E4E3E6\"/>\n<line x1=\"61.8\" y1=\"20.0\" x2=\"61.8\" y2=\"285.0\" stroke=\"#E8EEF0\"/>\n<line x1=\"106.0\" y1=\"20.0\" x2=\"106.0\" y2=\"285.0\" stroke=\"#E8EEF0\"/>\n<line x1=\"150.2\" y1=\"20.0\" x2=\"150.2\" y2=\"285.0\" stroke=\"#E8EEF0\"/>\n<line x1=\"194.3\" y1=\"20.0\" x2=\"194.3\" y2=\"285.0\" stroke=\"#E8EEF0\"/>\n<line x1=\"238.5\" y1=\"20.0\" x2=\"238.5\" y2=\"285.0\" stroke=\"#E8EEF0\"/>\n<line x1=\"282.7\" y1=\"20.0\" x2=\"282.7\" y2=\"285.0\" stroke=\"#E8EEF0\"/>\n<line x1=\"326.8\" y1=\"20.0\" x2=\"326.8\" y2=\"285.0\" stroke=\"#E8EEF0\"/>\n<line x1=\"371.0\" y1=\"20.0\" x2=\"371.0\" y2=\"285.0\" stroke=\"#E8EEF0\"/>\n<line x1=\"415.2\" y1=\"20.0\" x2=\"415.2\" y2=\"285.0\" stroke=\"#E8EEF0\"/>\n<line x1=\"61.8\" y1=\"285.0\" x2=\"415.2\" y2=\"285.0\" stroke=\"#E8EEF0\"/>\n<line x1=\"61.8\" y1=\"240.8\" x2=\"415.2\" y2=\"240.8\" stroke=\"#E8EEF0\"/>\n<line x1=\"61.8\" y1=\"196.7\" x2=\"415.2\" y2=\"196.7\" stroke=\"#E8EEF0\"/>\n<line x1=\"61.8\" y1=\"152.5\" x2=\"415.2\" y2=\"152.5\" stroke=\"#E8EEF0\"/>\n<line x1=\"61.8\" y1=\"108.3\" x2=\"415.2\" y2=\"108.3\" stroke=\"#E8EEF0\"/>\n<line x1=\"61.8\" y1=\"64.2\" x2=\"415.2\" y2=\"64.2\" stroke=\"#E8EEF0\"/>\n<line x1=\"61.8\" y1=\"20.0\" x2=\"415.2\" y2=\"20.0\" stroke=\"#E8EEF0\"/>\n<line x1=\"61.8\" y1=\"196.7\" x2=\"415.2\" y2=\"196.7\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>\n<line x1=\"282.7\" y1=\"20.0\" x2=\"282.7\" y2=\"285.0\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>\n<line x1=\"282.7\" y1=\"196.7\" x2=\"371.0\" y2=\"196.7\" stroke=\"#7B858A\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<line x1=\"371.0\" y1=\"196.7\" x2=\"282.7\" y2=\"108.3\" stroke=\"#7B858A\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<line x1=\"282.7\" y1=\"108.3\" x2=\"282.7\" y2=\"196.7\" stroke=\"#7B858A\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<line x1=\"194.3\" y1=\"196.7\" x2=\"282.7\" y2=\"108.3\" stroke=\"#B43123\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<line x1=\"282.7\" y1=\"108.3\" x2=\"106.0\" y2=\"108.3\" stroke=\"#B43123\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<line x1=\"106.0\" y1=\"108.3\" x2=\"194.3\" y2=\"196.7\" stroke=\"#B43123\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<circle cx=\"282.7\" cy=\"196.7\" r=\"4.5\" fill=\"#2B2527\"/>\n\n<circle cx=\"371.0\" cy=\"196.7\" r=\"4.5\" fill=\"#2B2527\"/>\n\n<circle cx=\"282.7\" cy=\"108.3\" r=\"4.5\" fill=\"#B43123\"/>\n<text x=\"289.7\" y=\"101.3\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#B43123\">z₃ = w₂</text>\n<circle cx=\"194.3\" cy=\"196.7\" r=\"4.5\" fill=\"#B43123\"/>\n\n<circle cx=\"106.0\" cy=\"108.3\" r=\"4.5\" fill=\"#B43123\"/>\n<text x=\"113.0\" y=\"101.3\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#B43123\">w₃</text>\n<text x=\"412.2\" y=\"189.7\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#2B2527\">Re</text>\n<text x=\"289.7\" y=\"32.0\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#2B2527\">Im</text>\n<text x=\"201.3\" y=\"189.7\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"3.6\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"#fff\">w₁</text><text x=\"201.3\" y=\"189.7\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#B43123\">w₁</text><text x=\"289.7\" y=\"189.7\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"3.6\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"#fff\">z₁</text><text x=\"289.7\" y=\"189.7\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#2B2527\">z₁</text><text x=\"378.0\" y=\"189.7\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"3.6\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"#fff\">z₂</text><text x=\"378.0\" y=\"189.7\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#2B2527\">z₂</text></svg></span><p>a) Bestäm bilderna \\(w_1,w_2,w_3\\).<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>b) Beskriv hur multiplikationen med \\(1+i\\) förändrar längder och vinklar innan förskjutningen \\(-2\\) görs.</p>",
    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p class=\"facit-metod\"><strong>Tänk så här:</strong> Använd en potens- eller logaritmlag i taget och skriv mellanled.</p></li><li><p class=\"facit-metod\">Det gör tecken, exponenter och eventuella villkor synliga.</p></li></ol><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">a)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"></div></div><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>\\[w_1=(1+i)\\cdot0-2=\\boxed{-2}.\\]</p></li><li><p>\\[w_2=(1+i)\\cdot2-2=2+2i-2=\\boxed{2i}.\\]</p></li><li><p>\\[w_3=(1+i)\\cdot2i-2=2i+2i^2-2=\\boxed{-4+2i}.\\]</p></li></ol><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">b)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>Talet \\(1+i\\) har absolutbelopp \\(\\sqrt2\\) och argument \\(\\pi/4\\).</p></li><li><p>Multiplikation med \\(1+i\\) <strong>förlänger därför alla längder med faktorn \\(\\sqrt2\\) och roterar figuren \\(45^\\circ\\) moturs</strong>.</p></li><li><p>Därefter flyttar termen \\(-2\\) hela figuren två enheter åt vänster.</p></li></ol></div></div></div></div>",
