    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">a)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[w_1=1+i\\],</div></li><li><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[w_2=3+3i\\],</div></li><li><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[w_3=(1+i)(1+2i)=-1+3i\\].</div></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">b)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>Faktoren \\(1+i\\) har absolutbelopp \\(\\sqrt2\\) och argument \\(\\pi/4\\).</p></li><li><p>Hela triangeln en <strong>rotation 45° moturs kring origo kombinerad med en förstoring med faktor \\(\\sqrt2\\)</strong>.</p></li></ol></div></div></div>",
