    "geogebra": true,
    "t": "<p>Ange koordinaterna \\((a,b)\\) i det komplexa talplanet.</p><p>a) \\(z=4+2i\\)<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>b) \\(z=-3+5i\\)<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>c) \\(z=-6-i\\)<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>d) \\(z=7\\)</p>",
    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p><strong>Metod:</strong> Talet \\(z=a+bi\\) motsvarar punkten \\((a,b)\\): realdelen ger x-koordinaten och koefficienten framför \\(i\\) ger y-koordinaten.</p></li></ol><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">a)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>\\(4+2i\\Rightarrow\\boxed{(4,2)}\\).</p></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">b)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>\\(-3+5i\\Rightarrow\\boxed{(-3,5)}\\).</p></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">c)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[-6-i=-6+(-1)i\\Rightarrow\\boxed{(-6,-1)}\\].</div></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">d)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[7=7+0i\\Rightarrow\\boxed{(7,0)}\\].</div></li></ol></div></div></div>",
