    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">a)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[r=\\sqrt2\\],</div></li><li><p>\\(v=\\pi/4\\): <strong>\\(\\sqrt2\\left(\\cos(\\pi/4)+i\\sin(\\pi/4)\\right)\\)</strong>.</p></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">b)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[r=\\sqrt2\\],</div></li><li><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[v=3\\pi/4\\].</div></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">c)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>\\(r=2\\), vinkeln ligger i tredje kvadranten med motsvarande vinkel i första kvadranten \\(\\pi/6\\): <strong>\\(2\\left(\\cos(7\\pi/6)+i\\sin(7\\pi/6)\\right)\\)</strong>.</p></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">d)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p><strong>\\(2\\left(\\cos(\\pi/2)+i\\sin(\\pi/2)\\right)\\)</strong>.</p></li></ol></div></div></div>",
