    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p><strong>Nyckelidé:</strong> Bestäm absolutbelopp och argument separat.</p></li><li><p>Vid multiplikation multipliceras absolutbeloppen och argumenten adderas.</p></li><li><div class=\"facit-berakning\"><p>Använd Eulers formel</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[e^{iv}=\\cos v+i\\sin v\\].</div></div></li></ol><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">a)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[\\boxed{1/2+(\\sqrt3/2)i}\\].</div></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">b)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>\\(\\boxed{-1}\\).</p></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">c)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[2(0-i)=\\boxed{-2i}\\].</div></li></ol></div></div></div>",
