    "miniräknare": true,
    "geogebra": true,
    "t": "<p>Lös \\(z^3=8\\) i de komplexa talen och markera rötterna i talplanet.</p><span class=\"fig\"><svg preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" width=\"420\" height=\"330\" viewBox=\"0 0 420 330\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Komplext talplan med lika skala på axlarna\"><rect x=\"1\" y=\"1\" width=\"418\" height=\"328\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#E4E3E6\"/><line x1=\"85.0\" y1=\"35\" x2=\"85.0\" y2=\"285\" stroke=\"#E8ECEF\"/><line x1=\"85.0\" y1=\"285.0\" x2=\"335.0\" y2=\"285.0\" stroke=\"#E8ECEF\"/><line x1=\"126.7\" y1=\"35\" x2=\"126.7\" y2=\"285\" stroke=\"#E8ECEF\"/><line x1=\"85.0\" y1=\"243.3\" x2=\"335.0\" y2=\"243.3\" stroke=\"#E8ECEF\"/><line x1=\"168.3\" y1=\"35\" x2=\"168.3\" y2=\"285\" stroke=\"#E8ECEF\"/><line x1=\"85.0\" y1=\"201.7\" x2=\"335.0\" y2=\"201.7\" stroke=\"#E8ECEF\"/><line x1=\"210.0\" y1=\"35\" x2=\"210.0\" y2=\"285\" stroke=\"#E8ECEF\"/><line x1=\"85.0\" y1=\"160.0\" x2=\"335.0\" y2=\"160.0\" stroke=\"#E8ECEF\"/><line x1=\"251.7\" y1=\"35\" x2=\"251.7\" y2=\"285\" stroke=\"#E8ECEF\"/><line x1=\"85.0\" y1=\"118.3\" x2=\"335.0\" y2=\"118.3\" stroke=\"#E8ECEF\"/><line x1=\"293.3\" y1=\"35\" x2=\"293.3\" y2=\"285\" stroke=\"#E8ECEF\"/><line x1=\"85.0\" y1=\"76.7\" x2=\"335.0\" y2=\"76.7\" stroke=\"#E8ECEF\"/><line x1=\"335.0\" y1=\"35\" x2=\"335.0\" y2=\"285\" stroke=\"#E8ECEF\"/><line x1=\"85.0\" y1=\"35.0\" x2=\"335.0\" y2=\"35.0\" stroke=\"#E8ECEF\"/><line x1=\"85.0\" y1=\"160.0\" x2=\"335.0\" y2=\"160.0\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><line x1=\"210.0\" y1=\"35\" x2=\"210.0\" y2=\"285\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><circle cx=\"293.3\" cy=\"160.0\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#B43123\"/><text x=\"300.3\" y=\"153.0\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"11.5\" fill=\"#B43123\">z1</text><circle cx=\"168.3\" cy=\"87.8\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#B43123\"/><text x=\"175.3\" y=\"80.8\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"11.5\" fill=\"#B43123\">z2</text><circle cx=\"168.3\" cy=\"232.2\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#B43123\"/><text x=\"175.3\" y=\"249.2\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"11.5\" fill=\"#B43123\">z3</text><text x=\"332.0\" y=\"152.0\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\">Re</text><text x=\"218.0\" y=\"47\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\">Im</text></svg></span><p>Ange både polär och rektangulär form.</p>",
    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p class=\"facit-metod\"><strong>Tänk så här:</strong> Använd en potens- eller logaritmlag i taget och skriv mellanled.</p></li><li><p class=\"facit-metod\">Det gör tecken, exponenter och eventuella villkor synliga.</p></li></ol><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[8=8e^{i2\\pi n}\\].</div></li><li><p>Rötterna har absolutbelopp 2 och argument</p></li><li><p>\\[v_k=\\frac{2\\pi k}{3},\\quad k=0,1,2.\\]</p></li><li><p>Polärt: \\(2e^{i0}\\),</p></li><li><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[2e^{i2\\pi/3}\\],</div></li><li><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[2e^{i4\\pi/3}\\].</div></li><li><p>På rektangulär form:</p></li><li><p>\\[\\boxed{2,\\quad -1+\\sqrt3 i,\\quad -1-\\sqrt3 i}.\\]</p></li></ol></div></div>",
    "familj": "Komplexa rötter med de Moivres formel",
