    "geogebra": false,
    "t": "<p>Använd de Moivres formel.</p><p>a) \\((2\\left(\\cos(\\pi/6)+i\\sin(\\pi/6)\\right))^3\\)<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>b) \\((\\sqrt2\\left(\\cos(\\pi/4)+i\\sin(\\pi/4)\\right))^4\\)<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>c) \\((3\\left(\\cos(2\\pi/3)+i\\sin(2\\pi/3)\\right))^2\\)<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>d) \\((2\\left(\\cos(5\\pi/6)+i\\sin(5\\pi/6)\\right))^6\\)</p>",
    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p class=\"facit-metod\"><strong>Tänk så här:</strong> Skriv talet som \\(r(\\cos v+i\\sin v)\\).</p></li><li><p class=\"facit-metod\">Vid en n:te potens upphöjs beloppet till n och argumentet multipliceras med n.</p></li></ol><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">a)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[8\\left(\\cos(\\pi/2)+i\\sin(\\pi/2)\\right)=\\boxed{8i}\\].</div></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">b)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[4\\left(\\cos(\\pi)+i\\sin(\\pi)\\right)=\\boxed{-4}\\].</div></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">c)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[9\\left(\\cos(4\\pi/3)+i\\sin(4\\pi/3)\\right)=\\boxed{-\\frac92-\\frac{9\\sqrt3}{2}i}\\].</div></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">d)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[64\\left(\\cos(5\\pi)+i\\sin(5\\pi)\\right)=\\boxed{-64}\\].</div></li></ol></div></div></div><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p class=\"facit-not\"><strong>Kontroll och insikt:</strong> Kontrollera beloppet separat: resultatets belopp ska vara ursprungsbeloppet upphöjt till n.</p></li></ol></div>",
