    "t": "<p>Lös ekvationerna och ange alla komplexa lösningar.</p><p>a) \\(z^2=4\\)<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>b) \\(z^2=-9\\)<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>c) \\(z^3=8\\)</p>",
    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p class=\"facit-metod\"><strong>Tänk så här:</strong> Använd en potens- eller logaritmlag i taget och skriv mellanled.</p></li><li><p class=\"facit-metod\">Det gör tecken, exponenter och eventuella villkor synliga.</p></li></ol><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">a)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p><strong>\\(z=\\pm2\\)</strong>.</p></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">b)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p><strong>\\(z=\\pm3i\\)</strong>.</p></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">c)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><div class=\"facit-berakning\"><p>Skriv</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[8=8\\left(\\cos(2k\\pi)+i\\sin(2k\\pi)\\right)\\].</div></div></li><li><p>Kubikrötterna har absolutbelopp 2 och argument \\(2k\\pi/3\\): <strong>\\(2,\\ -1+\\sqrt3i,\\ -1-\\sqrt3i\\)</strong>.</p></li></ol></div></div></div></div>",
