        "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">b)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[\\sqrt3-i=2(\\cos(-\\pi/6)+i\\sin(-\\pi/6))\\].</div></li><li><p>Därför\n\\[(\\sqrt3-i)^6=2^6(\\cos(-\\pi)+i\\sin(-\\pi))=-64.\\]\n−64 .</p></li></ol></div></div></div>",
        "niva": "C",
