    "t": "<p>Lös och ange alla komplexa rötter i polär form.</p><p>a) \\(z^2=9\\)<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>b) \\(z^2=-16\\)<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>c) \\(z^3=8\\)<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>d) \\(z^4=16\\)</p>",
    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p class=\"facit-metod\"><strong>Tänk så här:</strong> Använd en potens- eller logaritmlag i taget och skriv mellanled.</p></li><li><p class=\"facit-metod\">Det gör tecken, exponenter och eventuella villkor synliga.</p></li></ol><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">a)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p><strong>\\(3\\left(\\cos0+i\\sin0\\right)\\), \\(3\\left(\\cos\\pi+i\\sin\\pi\\right)\\)</strong>.</p></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">b)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p><strong>\\(4\\left(\\cos(\\pi/2)+i\\sin(\\pi/2)\\right)\\), \\(4\\left(\\cos(3\\pi/2)+i\\sin(3\\pi/2)\\right)\\)</strong>.</p></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">c)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p><strong>\\(2\\left(\\cos(0)+i\\sin(0)\\right),\\ 2\\left(\\cos(2\\pi/3)+i\\sin(2\\pi/3)\\right),\\ 2\\left(\\cos(4\\pi/3)+i\\sin(4\\pi/3)\\right)\\)</strong>.</p></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">d)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p><strong>\\(2\\left(\\cos(k\\pi/2)+i\\sin(k\\pi/2)\\right)\\), \\(k=0,1,2,3\\)</strong>.</p></li></ol></div></div></div></div>",
