"181.5\" x2=\"318.3\" y2=\"188.5\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"318.3\" y=\"200.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"3.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"#fff\">2</text><text x=\"318.3\" y=\"200.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#5C575E\">2</text><line x1=\"211.5\" y1=\"340.0\" x2=\"218.5\" y2=\"340.0\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"207.0\" y=\"343.5\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"3.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"#fff\">−3</text><text x=\"207.0\" y=\"343.5\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#5C575E\">−3</text><line x1=\"211.5\" y1=\"288.3\" x2=\"218.5\" y2=\"288.3\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"207.0\" y=\"291.8\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"3.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"#fff\">−2</text><text x=\"207.0\" y=\"291.8\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#5C575E\">−2</text><line x1=\"211.5\" y1=\"236.7\" x2=\"218.5\" y2=\"236.7\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"207.0\" y=\"240.2\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"3.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"#fff\">−1</text><text x=\"207.0\" y=\"240.2\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#5C575E\">−1</text><line x1=\"211.5\" y1=\"133.3\" x2=\"218.5\" y2=\"133.3\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"207.0\" y=\"136.8\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"3.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"#fff\">1</text><text x=\"207.0\" y=\"136.8\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#5C575E\">1</text><line x1=\"211.5\" y1=\"81.7\" x2=\"218.5\" y2=\"81.7\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"207.0\" y=\"85.2\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"3.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"#fff\">2</text><text x=\"207.0\" y=\"85.2\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#5C575E\">2</text><circle cx=\"215.0\" cy=\"185.0\" r=\"103.3\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#9A9AA0\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"310.5\" cy=\"145.5\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#B43123\"/><text x=\"321.5\" y=\"136.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"3.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"#fff\">z₁</text><text x=\"321.5\" y=\"136.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#B43123\">z₁</text><circle cx=\"175.5\" cy=\"89.5\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#B43123\"/><text x=\"164.5\" y=\"80.5\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"3.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"#fff\">z₂</text><text x=\"164.5\" y=\"80.5\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#B43123\">z₂</text><circle cx=\"119.5\" cy=\"224.5\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#B43123\"/><text x=\"108.5\" y=\"241.5\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"3.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"#fff\">z₃</text><text x=\"108.5\" y=\"241.5\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#B43123\">z₃</text><circle cx=\"254.5\" cy=\"280.5\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#B43123\"/><text x=\"265.5\" y=\"297.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"3.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"#fff\">z₄</text><text x=\"265.5\" y=\"297.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#B43123\">z₄</text></svg></span>",
    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p class=\"facit-metod\"><strong>Tänk så här:</strong> Använd en potens- eller logaritmlag i taget och skriv mellanled.</p></li><li><p class=\"facit-metod\">Det gör tecken, exponenter och eventuella villkor synliga.</p></li></ol><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>Skriv högerledet i polär form:</p></li><li><p>\\[\n16i=16\\left(\\cos\\frac{\\pi}{2}+i\\sin\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\right).\n\\]</p></li><li><p>Om \\(z=r(\\cos v+i\\sin v)\\), så krävs</p></li><li><p>\\[\nr^4=16\\Rightarrow r=2\n\\]</p></li><li><p>och</p></li><li><p>\\[\n4v=\\frac{\\pi}{2}+2\\pi k.\n\\]</p></li><li><p>Därför</p></li><li><p>\\[\nv=\\frac{\\pi}{8}+\\frac{\\pi}{2}k,\\qquad k=0,1,2,3.\n\\]</p></li></ol>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p class=\"facit-svar\"><strong>Rötterna är</strong></p>\n<ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>\\[\n2\\left(\\cos\\frac{\\pi}{8}+i\\sin\\frac{\\pi}{8}\\right),\\quad\n2\\left(\\cos\\frac{5\\pi}{8}+i\\sin\\frac{5\\pi}{8}\\right),\\quad\n2\\left(\\cos\\frac{9\\pi}{8}+i\\sin\\frac{9\\pi}{8}\\right),\\quad\n2\\left(\\cos\\frac{13\\pi}{8}+i\\sin\\frac{13\\pi}{8}\\right).\n\\]</p></li></ol></div></div>",
