    "niva": "E",
    "poang": "4/0/0",
    "miniräknare": false,
    "geogebra": false,
    "t": "<p>Använd de Moivres formel och skriv svaret på formen \\(a+bi\\).</p><p>a) \\([2\\left(\\cos(\\pi/6)+i\\sin(\\pi/6)\\right)]^3\\)<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>b) \\([3\\left(\\cos(\\pi/4)+i\\sin(\\pi/4)\\right)]^2\\)<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>c) \\([\\left(\\cos(2\\pi/3)+i\\sin(2\\pi/3)\\right)]^4\\)<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>d) \\([2\\left(\\cos(5\\pi/6)+i\\sin(5\\pi/6)\\right)]^2\\)</p>",
    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p class=\"facit-metod\"><strong>Tänk så här:</strong> Skriv talet som \\(r(\\cos v+i\\sin v)\\).</p></li><li><p class=\"facit-metod\">Vid en n:te potens upphöjs beloppet till n och argumentet multipliceras med n.</p></li></ol><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">a)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p><strong>\\(8\\left(\\cos(\\pi/2)+i\\sin(\\pi/2)\\right)=8i\\)</strong>.<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>b) <strong>\\(9\\left(\\cos(\\pi/2)+i\\sin(\\pi/2)\\right)=9i\\)</strong>.<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>c) \\(\\cos(8\\pi/3)+i\\sin(8\\pi/3)=\\cos(2\\pi/3)+i\\sin(2\\pi/3)=\\)<strong>\\(-\\frac12+\\frac{\\sqrt3}{2}i\\)</strong>.<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>d) \\(4\\left(\\cos(5\\pi/3)+i\\sin(5\\pi/3)\\right)=\\)<strong>\\(2-2\\sqrt3 i\\)</strong>.</p></li></ol></div></div></div><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p class=\"facit-not\"><strong>Kontroll och insikt:</strong> Kontrollera beloppet separat: resultatets belopp ska vara ursprungsbeloppet upphöjt till n.</p></li></ol></div>",
    "familj": "Potenser av komplexa tal med de Moivres formel",
