    "geogebra": false,
    "t": "<p>Beräkna med de Moivres formel.</p><p>a) \\((\\cos\\frac\\pi6+i\\sin\\frac\\pi6)^3\\)<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>b) \\((2(\\cos\\frac\\pi4+i\\sin\\frac\\pi4))^2\\)<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>c) \\((\\cos\\frac{2\\pi}{3}+i\\sin\\frac{2\\pi}{3})^3\\)<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>d) \\((3(\\cos\\frac\\pi2+i\\sin\\frac\\pi2))^2\\)</p>",
    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p class=\"facit-metod\"><strong>Tänk så här:</strong> Skriv talet som \\(r(\\cos v+i\\sin v)\\).</p></li><li><p class=\"facit-metod\">Vid en n:te potens upphöjs beloppet till n och argumentet multipliceras med n.</p></li></ol><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><div class=\"facit-berakning\"><p><strong>Formelbladet:</strong></p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[[r(\\cos v+i\\sin v)]^n=r^n(\\cos nv+i\\sin nv)\\].</div></div></li></ol><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">a)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>\\(\\cos(\\pi/2)+i\\sin(\\pi/2)=\\)<strong>\\(i\\)</strong>.</p></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">b)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>\\(4(\\cos(\\pi/2)+i\\sin(\\pi/2))=\\)<strong>\\(4i\\)</strong>.</p></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">c)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>\\(\\cos2\\pi+i\\sin2\\pi=\\)<strong>1</strong>.</p></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">d)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>\\(9(\\cos\\pi+i\\sin\\pi)=\\)<strong>−9</strong>.</p></li></ol></div></div></div><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p class=\"facit-not\"><strong>Kontroll och insikt:</strong> Kontrollera beloppet separat: resultatets belopp ska vara ursprungsbeloppet upphöjt till n.</p></li></ol></div>",
