    "t": "<p>Avgör med faktorsatsen om den angivna faktorn är en faktor.</p><p>a) \\(p(x)=x^3-4x^2+x+6\\), faktor \\(x-2\\).<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>b) \\(q(x)=x^3+2x^2-5x-6\\), faktor \\(x+1\\).<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>c) \\(r(x)=2x^3-3x^2-8x+12\\), faktor \\(x-2\\).<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>d) \\(s(x)=x^4-16\\), faktor \\(x+2\\).</p>",
    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p><strong>Metod:</strong> Sätt in det nollställe som hör ihop med faktorn.</p></li><li><p>Om värdet blir 0 är uttrycket en faktor.</p></li></ol><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">a)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>\\(p(2)=8-16+2+6=0\\): <strong>ja</strong>.</p></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">b)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>\\(q(-1)=-1+2+5-6=0\\): <strong>ja</strong>.</p></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">c)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>\\(r(2)=16-12-16+12=0\\): <strong>ja</strong>.</p></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">d)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>\\(s(-2)=16-16=0\\): <strong>ja</strong>.</p></li></ol></div></div></div>",
