    "geogebra": false,
    "t": "<p>Faktorisera fullständigt och lös.</p><p>a) \\(x^3-4x=0\\)<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>b) \\(x^3+x^2-4x-4=0\\)<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>c) \\(x^4-5x^2+4=0\\)</p>",
    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p><strong>Varför metoden fungerar:</strong> Faktorsatsen kopplar ett nollställe till en linjär faktor.</p></li><li><p>Med reella koefficienter måste dessutom icke-reella rötter förekomma i konjugatpar.</p></li></ol><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">a)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>\\(x(x^2-4)=x(x-2)(x+2)\\): <strong>\\(x=-2,0,2\\)</strong>.</p></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">b)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>Gruppera: \\(x^2(x+1)-4(x+1)=(x+1)(x-2)(x+2)\\): <strong>\\(x=-2,-1,2\\)</strong>.</p></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">c)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>Sätt \\(u=x^2\\): \\(u^2-5u+4=(u-1)(u-4)\\).</p></li><li><p>Alltså <strong>\\(x=\\pm1,\\pm2\\)</strong>.</p></li></ol></div></div></div>",
