    "miniräknare": false,
    "geogebra": false,
    "t": "<p>Lös ekvationerna.</p><p>a) \\(z^2+16=0\\)<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>b) \\(z^2-6z+13=0\\)<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>c) \\(z^2+4z+8=0\\)</p>",
    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p><strong>Metod:</strong> Använd andragradsformeln som vanligt.</p></li><li><div class=\"facit-berakning\"><p>När ett negativt tal hamnar under rottecknet använder du</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[i^2=-1\\].</div></div></li></ol><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">a)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[\\boxed{z=\\pm4i}\\].</div></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">b)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[z=(6\\pm\\sqrt{-16})/2=\\boxed{3\\pm2i}\\].</div></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">c)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[z=(-4\\pm\\sqrt{-16})/2=\\boxed{-2\\pm2i}\\].</div></li></ol></div></div></div>",
