    "miniräknare": true,
    "geogebra": false,
    "t": "<p>Utför polynomdivision.</p><p>a) \\(\\frac{x^2+5x+6}{x+2}\\)<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>b) \\(\\frac{x^3-8}{x-2}\\)<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>c) \\(\\frac{2x^3+x^2-8x-4}{x+2}\\)<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>d) \\(\\frac{3x^3-10x^2+x+6}{x-3}\\)</p>",
    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p class=\"facit-metod\"><strong>Tänk så här:</strong> Polynomdivision delar ett polynom term för term.</p></li><li><p class=\"facit-metod\">Ordna först termerna efter fallande grad och skriv ut saknade potensgrader med koefficienten noll.</p></li></ol><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">a)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>\\(x^2+5x+6=(x+2)(x+3)\\), alltså \\(\\boxed{x+3}\\).</p></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">b)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>Divisionen ger \\(\\boxed{x^2+2x+4}\\).</p></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">c)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>Divisionen ger \\(\\boxed{2x^2-3x-2}\\).</p></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">d)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>Divisionen ger \\(\\boxed{3x^2-x-2}\\).</p></li></ol></div></div><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>I samtliga fall är resten 0.</p></li></ol></div><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p class=\"facit-not\"><strong>Kontroll och insikt:</strong> Kontrollera identiteten: dividend = divisor · kvot + rest.</p></li></ol></div>",
