    "t": "<p>Utför polynomdivision.</p><p>a) \\((x^4+2x^2-3)/(x-1)\\)<br><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:block;height:7px\"></span>b) \\((2x^4-x^3+5)/(x+2)\\)</p>",
    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">a)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>Skriv först den saknade termen som \\(0x^3\\).</p></li><li><p>Divisionen ger kvoten <strong>\\(x^3+x^2+3x+3\\)</strong> och resten <strong>0</strong>.</p></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">b)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>Skriv \\(2x^4-x^3+0x^2+0x+5\\).</p></li><li><p>Divisionen ger kvoten <strong>\\(2x^3-5x^2+10x-20\\)</strong> och resten <strong>45</strong>.</p></li></ol></div></div></div>",
