    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>\\[\\frac{x^2-1}{x-1}=\\frac{(x+1)(x-1)}{x-1}=x+1\\]</p></li></ol><p class=\"facit-svar\"><strong>Svar:</strong> \\(x+1\\)</p></div>",
