        "t": "<p>Derivera funktionen.</p><p>\\(y=-5e^{-5x}+1\\)</p>",
        "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[y^{\\prime}=-5\\cdot(-5)e^{-5x}=25e^{-5x}\\].</div></li></ol><p class=\"facit-svar\"><strong>Svar:</strong> \\(y^{\\prime}=25e^{-5x}\\)</p></div>",
