        "t": "<p>Derivera funktionen.</p><p>\\(y=4\\cos4x+3\\sin6x\\)</p>",
        "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[y^{\\prime}=-16\\sin4x+18\\cos6x\\].</div></li></ol><p class=\"facit-svar\"><strong>Svar:</strong> \\(y^{\\prime}=-16\\sin4x+18\\cos6x\\)</p></div>",
