        "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[y^{\\prime}=7\\cos(7x-2)\\].</div></li></ol><p class=\"facit-svar\"><strong>Svar:</strong> \\(y^{\\prime}=7\\cos(7x-2)\\)</p></div>",
