    "miniräknare": true,
    "geogebra": false,
    "t": "<p>Derivera \\(f(x)=(x+1)(x-3)\\) med produktregeln.</p>",
    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><div class=\"facit-berakning\"><p><strong>Produktregeln:</strong></p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[(uv)'=u'v+uv'\\].</div></div></li><li><div class=\"facit-berakning\"><p>Här är</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[u=x+1\\],</div></div></li><li><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[u'=1\\],</div></li><li><p>\\(v=x-3\\) och \\(v'=1\\).</p></li><li><p>\\[f'(x)=1\\cdot(x-3)+(x+1)\\cdot1=2x-2\\]</p></li></ol><p class=\"facit-svar\"><strong>Svar:</strong> \\(f'(x)=2x-2\\)</p><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p><strong>Kontroll:</strong> \\(f(x)=x^2-2x-3\\) ger \\(f'(x)=2x-2\\).</p></li></ol></div>",
