    "geogebra": false,
    "t": "<p>Derivera \\(f(x)=x\\sin x\\).</p>",
    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><div class=\"facit-berakning\"><p><strong>Produktregeln:</strong></p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[(uv)'=u'v+uv'\\].</div></div></li><li><div class=\"facit-berakning\"><p>Här är</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[u=x\\],</div></div></li><li><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[u'=1\\],</div></li><li><p>\\(v=\\sin x\\) och \\(v'=\\cos x\\).</p></li><li><p>\\[f'(x)=1\\cdot\\sin x+x\\cos x\\]</p></li></ol><p class=\"facit-svar\"><strong>Svar:</strong> \\(f'(x)=\\sin x+x\\cos x\\)</p></div>",
